LowerInstrModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: Lowers a single AST instruction node into an IR instruction: takes Op/Params/Returns, maps op via MapOp (Ctrl.Call to IR.Call with dst), expands arguments via LowerArgs; returns the IR instruction.
    Provides: LowerInstr(node) -> ir.
    DependsOn: MapOp, LowerArgs, LowerMemKind, SplitArgs.
    Composition: Native include from modules/Compiler/Compiler.sir (Path: ../LowerInstr/LowerInstr.sir).
